    aiImpact: ["AI is rapidly changing the production side of marketing: drafting copy, generating creative variations, analyzing campaign data, and personalizing content at scale. This compresses time spent on execution and shifts the role toward strategy, brand judgment, and knowing which message will actually resonate, things AI cannot reliably decide. Performance and growth roles that pair creativity with strong analytics are in steady demand; purely execution-focused roles are more exposed. The managers who advance use AI to move faster while owning the taste and strategy that distinguish a brand."],
